# LLVM Phalanx — 12-role assignment for phases 1–3

File: openOODA/audit/plan_llvm_phalanx.oot
COORD assignment. C emit + gcc remains the product path. Do not overwrite oodac/oodac.
Pin: v0.205.0-beta. Lane: LLVM emit only.

## 1. Observe

  Cold `check fixtures/hello.oo` on an LLVM-linked oodac failed because
  `llvm_emit_expr` lowered `match` expressions to `%OoStr zeroinitializer`.
  `load_source_with_imports` uses `let src = match read_file { Ok(s) => s, ... }`.
  Empty src prints `ERR check empty`. Stamp-walk still worked (no match expr).

## 2. Roles and disjoint files

| Role | Job | Owns |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| COORD | Assign, rebuild side ELF, rollup | audit/plan_llvm_phalanx.oot, scratch logs |
| DE1 | Match-expression emit | oodac/llvm_emit_match_expr.oo, llvm_emit_expr.oo |
| DE2 | Call/method leftovers | oodac/llvm_emit_method.oo, llvm_fntab.oo |
| RT | C ABI vs LLVM preamble | audit/plan_llvm_rt.oot (runtime write only if ABI is wrong) |
| PV1 | Hostile mutate hello | scripts/open68_pv1_hostile.oo |
| PV2 | Planted g_ must not be required | scripts/open68_pv2_plant.oo |
| SEC | Shim/cap audit | audit/plan_llvm_sec.oot |
| MEM | ARC on match/check | audit/plan_llvm_mem.oot |
| INT | Run smokes and C path | scratch logs only |
| HARN | Phase 1–3 smokes | scripts/open68_cold_hello_smoke.oo, open68_main_check_smoke.oo, open68_cmds_floor_smoke.oo, open68_match_expr_smoke.oo |
| HYG | Line lock <=256 | report only unless a file exceeds 256 |
| DOCS | Boards after INT proof | SHIPPED.oot, ROADMAP.oot leftover rows |

Do not edit `c_emit*.oo`. Do not copy `bin/ooda` onto `oodac/oodac`.
Shared `main.oo` / `cli_emit.oo` stay COORD-serialized (no edit this cycle).

